4. Modulus modulus: The modulus modulus of polyethylene-based nanocomposites can also be improved by the addition of GO. This is due to the high stiffness of GO and its ability to reinforce the polymer matrix. The presence of GO can help to maintain the stiffness of the polymer matrix under stress, leading to improved modulus modulus.

5. Toughness: The toughness of polyethylene-based nanocomposites can be improved by the addition of GO. This is due to the ability of GO to provide a stress sink, which can help to dissipate the energy of impact and prevent the crack propagation in the polymer matrix.

