\[
\text{Geometric Mean} = \left( \prod_{i=1}^n TF_i \right)^{1/n} = \left(TF_1 \times TF_2 \times TF_3 \times \cdots \times TF_n\right)^{1/n}
\]

**Step 1: Gather the Transfer Factor Values**
