   The proposition is of the form "" If \( p \), then \( q \), "" where \( p \) is \( A \cup B = A \) and \( q \) is \( A \cap B = B \).  

2. **Negate the conditional statement:**  
   The negation of "" If \( p \), then \( q \) "" is "" \( p \) and not \( q \). ""  

