   \[
   1 = a b^2 \quad \text{(2)}
   \]

Substitute equation (1) into equation (2):
\[
1 = 6b^2 \cdot b^2 \implies 1 = 6b^4 \implies b^4 = \frac{1}{6} \implies b = \sqrt{\frac{1}{6}} = \frac{1}{\sqrt{6}} = \frac{1}{3\sqrt{2}} = \frac{\sqrt{6}}{6}
\]
