\[
\Delta K = K_{\text{in}} - K_{\text{out}} = K_{\text{in}} - \frac{1}{9} K_{\text{in}} = \frac{8}{9} K_{\text{in}}
\]

The fraction of kinetic energy lost is:
\[
\frac{\Delta K}{K_{\text{in}}} = \frac{\frac{8}{9} K_{\text{in}}}{K_{\text{in}}} = \frac{8}{9}
\]

