where \( I_c' \) is the forward current at \( V_{CEO} = 0 \).

At breakdown, the base current \( I_B \) is negligible, so \( I_c = I_c' \left(1 - \frac{V_{CEO}}{V_{CBO}}\right)^{1/2} \).

