\[
-1.0 \text{ V} = -\frac{1}{2} V_{SB}
\]

\[
V_{SB} = 2 \times 1.0 \text{ V} = 2.0 \text{ V}
\]

Thus, the required \(V_{BS}\) is \(\boxed{2.0 \text{ V}}\).
