\]
where \(\sigma = 5.67 \times 10^{-8} \, \text{W m}^{-2} \, \text{K}^{-4}\) is the Stefan-Boltzmann constant.

Thus, the intensity of thermal radiation of a black body in terms of the temperature \( T \) and wavelength \( \lambda \) is:
