\[
Q^2 = \left( \frac{E_f - E_i}{c} \right)^2 + p_f^2 - 2 \mathbf{p}_f \cdot \mathbf{p}_i + p_i^2
\]

The dot product \( \mathbf{p}_f \cdot \mathbf{p}_i \) is the dot product of the final and initial momentum vectors.

